  "notes": [
    "This is the VCF Operations API itself (specifications/vcf-operations/vcf-operations-openapi.json), not the sibling log-management-openapi.json in the same directory.",
    "The specification declares the security scheme 'Token-based-authorization' as an apiKey in the 'Authorization' header but does not fix the header value prefix. VCF Operations 9.1 issues 'Authorization: OpsToken <token>' as the primary form; 'vRealizeOpsToken' remains the accepted legacy form. docs/contract.json pins the primary form in security.value_format."
